再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1004","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[78,72,75,65,61,72],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1004","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[78,72,75,65,61,72],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1004","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[78,72,75,65,61,72],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,72,75,65,61,72],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"11950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,72,75,65,61,72],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"11950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将，孙鲁班之夫。石亭之战时，与陆逊等人一同作战，并击退魏国大将曹休，斩获万余人，缴获辎重无数，直接导致曹魏淮南防线收缩。赤乌四年，面对王凌突袭，先以中军坚守消耗魏军，再令子全绪、全端追击，成功扭转败局。蜀国后期休整期间，负责驻守巴丘，注视着蜀吴的动向。二宫之争中依附鲁王孙霸，其子全寄成为孙霸党羽核心，导致与陆逊、顾谭等太子党对立。晚年为维护家族利益，默许儿子全怿、全端参与孙綝专权，间接导致家族成员后来降魏。","tc":"吳國武將，孫魯班之夫。石亭之戰時，與陸遜等人一同作戰，并擊退魏國大將曹休，斬獲萬余人，繳獲輜重無數，直接導致曹魏淮南防線收縮。赤烏四年，面對王凌突襲，先以中軍堅守消耗魏軍，再令子全緒、全端追擊，成功扭轉敗局。蜀國后期休整期間，負責駐守巴丘，注視著蜀吳的動向。二宮之爭中依附魯王孫霸，其子全寄成為孫霸黨羽核心，導致與陸遜、顧譚等太子黨對立。晚年為維護家族利益，默許兒子全懌、全端參與孫綝專權，間接導致家族成員后來降魏。","en":"An officer of Wu, husband of Sun Luban. At the Battle of Shiting he fought alongside Lu Xun and others, defeating the Wei Grand General Cao Xiu with over ten thousand enemy casualties and vast captured supplies, directly causing Wei's Huainan defense line to contract. In the fourth year of Chiwu (241), when Wang Ling launched a surprise attack, he first held firm with his central army to exhaust the Wei forces, then sent his sons Quan Xu and Quan Duan to pursue, successfully reversing the setback. During a quiet period in Shu's later years, he was assigned to garrison Baqiu to monitor developments between Shu and Wu. In the Two Palaces succession crisis, he aligned with Prince Lu Sun Ba, and his son Quan Ji became a core member of Sun Ba's faction, bringing him into conflict with Lu Xun, Gu Tan, and other supporters of the Crown Prince. In his later years, to protect his family's interests, he tacitly allowed his sons Quan Yi and Quan Duan to participate in Sun Chen's seizure of power, indirectly leading to family members later surrendering to Wei.","jp":"呉の武将で、孫魯班の夫。石亭の戦いでは陸遜らと共に戦って魏の大将・曹休を撃退し、一万人余りを討ち取り無数の輜重を鹵獲して、曹魏の淮南防衛線を後退させる直接の契機を作った。赤烏四年、王凌の急襲を受けた際には、まず中軍で堅守して魏軍を消耗させ、次いで子の全緒や全端に追撃を命じて敗勢を覆すことに成功した。蜀の後期の休養期間には巴丘の駐屯を任され、蜀呉両国の動向を注視した。二宮の変では魯王・孫覇に与し、子の全寄が孫覇派の中核となったことで、陸遜や顧譚ら太子派と対立した。晩年は家族の利益を守るため、子の全懌や全端が孫綝の専権に加担することを黙認し、間接的に家族が後に魏へ降伏する原因を作った。","kr":"오나라의 무장이자 손루반의 남편이다. 석정 전투 당시 육손 등과 함께 참전하여 위나라 대장 조휴를 격퇴하고 1만여 명을 베거나 사로잡았으며, 수많은 치중을 노획하여 조위의 회남 방어선이 후퇴하는 직접적인 계기를 마련했다. 적오 4년, 왕릉의 기습에 맞서 먼저 중군을 이끌고 굳게 버티며 위군을 소모시킨 뒤, 아들 전서와 전단에게 추격을 명하여 패색이 짙던 전세를 성공적으로 뒤집었다. 촉나라 후기 정비 기간에는 파구의 수비를 맡아 촉과 오의 동향을 주시했다. 이궁의 변에서는 노왕 손패의 편에 섰으며, 아들 전기가 손패 당여의 핵심 인물이 되면서 육손, 고담 등의 태자파와 대립했다. 말년에는 가문의 이익을 지키고자 아들 전역과 전단이 손침의 전횡에 가담하는 것을 묵인하였고, 이는 훗날 가문 구성원들이 위에 투항하는 간접적인 원인이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10197","remark":"","surname":"全","surnameTc":"全","surnameEn":"Quan","surnameJp":"全","surnameKr":"전","surnameOther":"","name":"琮","nameTc":"琮","nameEn":"Cong","nameJp":"琮","nameKr":"종","nameOther":"","word":"子璜","wordTc":"子璜","wordEn":"Zihuang","wordJp":"子璜","wordKr":"자황","wordOther":"","icon":"全琮","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"202","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"72","wise":"75","politics":"65","charm":"61","will":"72","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"20/72/20/20/20/48/50/20","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1002402;1006302","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012405","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"5100","debateSoulPoint":"5600","strategy":"1003208","strategy2":"1005401","professions":"2/3/0/3/3/4/3/0/3/2/4/3/3/1/4/1/2/0/1/2/1/1/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"85","loyalty":"0","reputation":"11950","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"183","show":"202","death":"249","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"6","weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1019705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;26/1;31/1;58/1;2/1;42/1;36/1;21/2;57/2","father":"","mother":"","children":"WJ10467/100","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"吴国武将，孙鲁班之夫。石亭之战时，与陆逊等人一同作战，并击退魏国大将曹休，斩获万余人，缴获辎重无数，直接导致曹魏淮南防线收缩。赤乌四年，面对王凌突袭，先以中军坚守消耗魏军，再令子全绪、全端追击，成功扭转败局。蜀国后期休整期间